om<svg class=\"w-3.5 h-3.5\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" d=\"M7 17L17 7M9 7h8v8\"></path></svg></a></div></div></div></section><section id=\"track-record\" class=\"py-14 lg:py-20 scroll-mt-20\"><div class=\"mx-auto max-w-6xl px-6\"><p class=\"text-xs font-semibold tracking-[0.2em] text-brand uppercase mb-4\">Track record</p><p class=\"text-text-secondary leading-relaxed max-w-3xl mb-10\">Before plaintiff law, GTM Partner LLC ran revenue and outbound programs for 50 plus companies, from seed stage to Fortune 500.</p><div class=\"flex flex-wrap items-center gap-x-7 gap-y-4 mb-12\"><div class=\"flex items-center gap-2 group\"><img src=\"/logos/worldpay.png\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"w-5 h-5 rounded-sm object-contain opacity-70 group-hover:opacity-100 transition-opacity\"/><span class=\"text-xs font-medium text-text-secondary whitespace-nowrap\">Worldpay</span></div><div class=\"flex items-center gap-2 group\"><img src=\"/logos/cloudzero.png\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"w-5 h-5 rounded-sm object-contain opacity-70 group-hover:opacity-100 transition-opacity\"/><span class=\"text-xs font-medium text-text-secondary whitespace-nowrap\">CloudZero</span></div><div class=\"flex items-center gap-2 group\"><img src=\"/logos/cerby.png\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"w-5 h-5 rounded-sm object-contain opacity-70 group-hover:opacity-100 transition-opacity\"/><span class=\"text-xs font-medium text-text-secondary whitespace-nowrap\">Cerby</span></div><div class=\"flex items-center gap-2 group\"><img src=\"/logos/electric-era.png\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"w-5 h-5 rounded-sm object-contain opacity-70 group-hover:opacity-100 transition-opacity\"/><span class=\"text-xs font-medium text-text-secondary whitespace-nowrap\">Electric Era</span></div><div class=\"flex items-center gap-2 group\"><img src=\"/logos/cloud-capital.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"w-5 h-5 rounded-sm object-contain opacity-70 group-hover:opacity-100 transition-opacity\"/><span class=\"text-xs font-medium text-text-secondary whitespace-nowrap\">Cloud Capital</span></div><div class=\"flex items-center gap-2 group\"><img src=\"/logos/multipasss.png\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"w-5 h-5 rounded-sm object-contain opacity-70 group-hover:opacity-100 transition-opacity\"/><span class=\"text-xs font-medium text-text-secondary whitespace-nowrap\">MultiPasss</span></div><div class=\"flex items-center gap-2 group\"><img src=\"/logos/customlab.png\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"w-5 h-5 rounded-sm object-contain opacity-70 group-hover:opacity-100 transition-opacity\"/><span class=\"text-xs font-medium text-text-secondary whitespace-nowrap\">CustomLab</span></div><div class=\"flex items-center gap-2 group\"><img src=\"/logos/verifytx.png\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"w-5 h-5 rounded-sm object-contain opacity-70 group-hover:opacity-100 transition-opacity\"/><span class=\"text-xs font-medium text-text-secondary whitespace-nowrap\">VerifyTx</span></div><div class=\"flex items-center gap-2 group\"><img src=\"/logos/kelley-austin.png\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"w-5 h-5 rounded-sm object-contain opacity-70 group-hover:opacity-100 transition-opacity\"/><span class=\"text-xs font-medium text-text-secondary whitespace-nowrap\">Kelley Austin</span></div><div class=\"flex items-center gap-2 group\"><img src=\"/logos/ceo-coaching.png\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"w-5 h-5 rounded-sm object-contain opacity-70 group-hover:opacity-100 transition-opacity\"/><span class=\"text-xs font-medium text-text-secondary whitespace-nowrap\">CEO Coaching Intl</span></div><div class=\"flex items-center gap-2 group\"><img src=\"/logos/7eagle.png\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"w-5 h-5 rounded-sm object-contain opacity-70 group-hover:opacity-100 transition-opacity\"/><span class=\"text-xs font-medium text-text-secondary whitespace-nowrap\">7Eagle</span></div></div><div class=\"grid sm:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-3 gap-4\"><div class=\"card !p-6 flex flex-col\"><div class=\"flex items-center gap-3 mb-1\"><span class=\"w-7 h-7 rounded-md bg-white/10 flex items-center justify-center p-1 shrink-0\"><img src=\"/logos/worldpay.png\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"w-full h-full object-contain\"/></span><h3 class=\"text-base font-semibold text-text-primary\">Worldpay</h3></div><p class=\"text-xs text-text-muted mb-4\">Fortune 500, B2B payments</p><p class=\"text-sm text-text-secondary leading-relaxed flex-1\">Cleaned and enriched 110,000+ CRM records across multiple HubSpot instances with a 35% duplication rate.</p><div class=\"mt-5 pt-4 border-t border-border-subtle\"><div class=\"text-xl font-bold stat-value\">110K+</div><div class=\"text-xs text-text-muted\">Records cleaned</div></div></div><div class=\"card !p-6 flex flex-col\"><div class=\"flex items-center gap-3 mb-1\"><span class=\"w-7 h-7 rounded-md bg-white/10 flex items-center justify-center p-1 shrink-0\"><img src=\"/logos/electric-era.png\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"w-full h-full object-contain\"/></span><h3 class=\"text-base font-semibold text-text-primary\">Electric Era</h3></div><p class=\"text-xs text-text-muted mb-4\">EV charging infrastructure</p><p class=\"text-sm text-text-secondary leading-relaxed flex-1\">Built a signal-based outbound engine for enterprise EV charging buyers: multi-domain email, LinkedIn and real-time intent alerts.</p><div class=\"mt-5 pt-4 border-t border-border-subtle\"><div class=\"text-xl font-bold stat-value\">$53.5M</div><div class=\"text-xs text-text-muted\">Pipeline created</div></div></div><div class=\"card !p-6 flex flex-col\"><div class=\"flex items-center gap-3 mb-1\"><span class=\"w-7 h-7 rounded-md bg-white/10 flex items-center justify-center p-1 shrink-0\"><img src=\"/logos/cloud-capital.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"w-full h-full object-contain\"/></span><h3 class=\"text-base font-semibold text-text-primary\">Cloud Capital</h3></div><p class=\"text-xs text-text-muted mb-4\">B2B SaaS</p><p class=\"text-sm text-text-secondary leading-relaxed flex-1\">Three Clay automation workflows for funding triggers, new-role targeting and CRM enrichment, replacing 80% of SDR workload.</p><div class=\"mt-5 pt-4 border-t border-border-subtle\"><div class=\"text-xl font-bold stat-value\">$105K</div><div class=\"text-xs text-text-muted\">Monthly savings</div></div></div><div class=\"card !p-6 flex flex-col\"><div class=\"flex items-center gap-3 mb-1\"><span class=\"w-7 h-7 rounded-md bg-white/10 flex items-center justify-center p-1 shrink-0\"><img src=\"/logos/customlab.png\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"w-full h-full object-contain\"/></span><h3 class=\"text-base font-semibold text-text-primary\">CustomLab by Outway</h3></div><p class=\"text-xs text-text-muted mb-4\">B2B custom merchandise</p><p class=\"text-sm text-text-secondary leading-relaxed flex-1\">Targeted procurement decision-makers at 500+ universities with automated portfolio sharing.</p><div class=\"mt-5 pt-4 border-t border-border-subtle\"><div class=\"text-xl font-bold stat-value\">5x</div><div class=\"text-xs text-text-muted\">ROI multiple</div></div></div><div class=\"card !p-6 flex flex-col\"><div class=\"flex items-center gap-3 mb-1\"><span class=\"w-7 h-7 rounded-md bg-white/10 flex items-center justify-center p-1 shrink-0\"><img src=\"/logos/multipasss.png\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"w-full h-full object-contain\"/></span><h3 class=\"text-base font-semibold text-text-primary\">MultiPasss</h3></div><p class=\"text-xs text-text-muted mb-4\">Product design agency</p><p class=\"text-sm text-text-secondary leading-relaxed flex-1\">Four-month engagement: cold TAM engine, LinkedIn re-engagement and website de-anonymization.</p><div class=\"mt-5 pt-4 border-t border-border-subtle\"><div class=\"text-xl font-bold stat-value\">56</div><div class=\"text-xs text-text-muted\">Qualified leads</div></div></div><div class=\"card !p-6 flex flex-col\"><div class=\"flex items-center gap-3 mb-1\"><span class=\"w-7 h-7 rounded-md bg-white/10 flex items-center justify-center p-1 shrink-0\"><img src=\"/logos/7eagle.png\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"w-full h-full object-contain\"/></span><h3 class=\"text-base font-semibold text-text-primary\">7Eagle</h3></div><p class=\"text-xs text-text-muted mb-4\">Staffing and recruiting</p><p class=\"text-sm text-text-secondary leading-relaxed flex-1\">Real-time hiring activity tracking across thousands of companies with instant CRM and ATS push.</p><div class=\"mt-5 pt-4 border-t border-border-subtle\"><div class=\"text-xl font-bold stat-value\">2.5x</div><div class=\"text-xs text-text-muted\">Qualified leads</div></div></div></div></div></section><section class=\"py-14 lg:py-20 bg-surface-raised\"><div class=\"mx-auto max-w-6xl px-6\"><div class=\"rounded-xl border border-brand/20 bg-surface p-8 lg:p-10 grid lg:grid-cols-[1fr_auto] gap-8 items-center\"><div><p class=\"text-xs font-semibold tracking-[0.2em] text-brand uppercase mb-4\">The one thing we sell here</p><h2 class=\"text-2xl sm:text-3xl font-bold text-text-primary mb-4\">Exclusive MVA leads for PI firms</h2><p class=\"text-text-secondary leading-relaxed max-w-2xl\">Phone-verified, long-form qualified, delivered to your CRM within minutes. Pay per lead or a flat management fee inside your own ad account.</p></div><a class=\"btn-primary justify-center whitespace-nowrap\" href=\"/leads\">See the lead offer →</a></div></div></section><section class=\"py-14 lg:py-20\"><div class=\"mx-auto max-w-6xl px-6\"><p class=\"text-xs font-semibold tracking-[0.2em] text-brand uppercase mb-4\">Campaigns we run with our media buying partners</p><h2 class=\"reveal text-3xl sm:text-4xl font-bold text-text-primary mb-4\">Exclusive leads sign at 10 to 20%. Shared leads sign at 2 to 5%.</h2><p class=\"text-text-secondary leading-relaxed max-w-2xl mb-12\">Screenshots from live accounts, shared with permission.</p><div class=\"grid md:grid-cols-2 gap-6\"><div class=\"reveal card !p-6 lg:!p-8\"><p class=\"text-xs font-semibold tracking-[0.2em] text-text-muted uppercase mb-3\">Google Ads, February 2026</p><h3 class=\"text-xl font-bold text-text-primary mb-6\">$368K in one month. 2,354 people asked for help.</h3><img alt=\"Google Ads MVA campaign performance, February 2026\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"900\" height=\"500\" decoding=\"async\" data-nimg=\"1\" class=\"rounded-lg border border-border-subtle w-full h-auto\" style=\"color:transparent\" sizes=\"(min-width: 768px) 540px, 100vw\" srcSet=\"/_next/image?url=%2Fproof-google-ads.png&amp;w=640&amp;q=75 640w, /_next/image?url=%2Fproof-google-ads.png&amp;w=750&amp;q=75 750w, /_next/image?url=%2Fproof-google-ads.png&amp;w=828&amp;q=75 828w, /_next/image?url=%2Fproof-google-ads.png&amp;w=1080&amp;q=75 1080w, /_next/image?url=%2Fproof-google-ads.png&amp;w=1200&amp;q=75 1200w, /_next/image?url=%2Fproof-google-ads.png&amp;w=1920&amp;q=75 1920w, /_next/image?url=%2Fproof-google-ads.png&amp;w=2048&amp;q=75 2048w, /_next/image?url=%2Fproof-google-ads.png&amp;w=3840&amp;q=75 3840w\" src=\"/_next/image?url=%2Fproof-google-ads.png&amp;w=3840&amp;q=75\"/></div><div class=\"reveal card !p-6 lg:!p-8\"><p class=\"text-xs font-semibold tracking-[0.2em] text-text-muted uppercase mb-3\">A partner firm, after the first batch</p><h3 class=\"text-xl font-bold text-text-primary mb-6\">“We want to try 100 more leads.”</h3><img alt=\"Email from a partner firm aski